equipment: Astra A01 specialist review register (H04 and P13 additions), utilities evidence pack (`utilities.md`), and frozen historical records.
action: Preserve `Z13-R03` explicitly as a labeled `Reconstruction draft` tied to the unrecovered Home Resilience primer while keeping all 69 newly authored Z13 cards bound to current FEMA, CPSC, NFPA, EPA, CDC, and Minnesota Department of Health primary sources. @U01,C09,ED
action: Treat every Z13 electrical, heating, water-heater, well, and septic diagram strictly as a conceptual safety boundary—NEVER as an engineered installation drawing, wiring schematic, or substitute for local building codes and manufacturer manuals. @U02,U03,U06
action: Maintain `publication: HOLD` and zero qualified human trade approvals across all 70 Z13 pages until licensed electricians, fire/HVAC/gas specialists, licensed well/septic engineers, and public-health reviewers complete formal sign-off. @U02,U11,U05
